loading_tips = PackedStringArray("Wind-up Soldiers stop to wind their keys before they march: step aside and they march straight past.", "Plush Brutes squash down before they bounce. A ring marks where they land: get out of it or be bounced back.", "The window display is high ground with a view of the whole floor: book stairs climb it at both ends.", "The dollhouse has two floors and a stair along its back wall. Its open side faces the station.", "When the music box plays, the whole horde is wound up. When it winds down, they nearly stop: that is your moment.", "The Toymaker drops building blocks where you stand. Keep moving, and shoot the glow when he winds down.")
